2025-08-02 20:06:55,289 [INFO] models.read_document - Request successful for url https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/vidyarth-systems.firebasestorage.app/o/compendium%2Fadobe%2Fadobe-compendium.pdf?alt=media&token=627cd45e-6bb7-4945-9ab7-aafa94f7788c
